  "published": "2026-10-16T13:13:07.473Z",
  "readmeFile": "PACKAGE-README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.6.2: packaging fixes - the native libraries were nested under a doubled runtimes/ prefix in all earlier packages, so NuGet never copied them to consuming builds (referencing the package alone did not work); the layout is now the standard runtimes/{rid}/native. The package also ships a build-translation targets file that copies the native library into the output of RID-less (default debug) builds. No library changes; the binaries are identical to 1.6.0 and volumes are compatible with 1.4.x/1.5.x/1.6.0 (same vcapi v4).",
